<title>HONG KONG: CDW shareholders approve Dollfus purchase.</title>
<headline>CDW shareholders approve Dollfus purchase.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CDW International Ltd said on Friday shareholders at an extraordinary general meeting approved the company's plan to buy a 6.1 percent stake in France's Dollfus Mieg &amp; Cie with warrants for HK$147 million.</p>
<p>CDW said in a statement the deal was expected to be completed on September 30.</p>
<p>In August, CDW said the company's stake in Dollfus Mieg &amp; Cie could be raised to 16.3 percent if the warrants were fully exercised.</p>
<p>CDW shares were untraded at HK$0.70 each on Friday morning.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
